    dc:title "GABA and glutamate signalling in epileptogenesis"@en ;
    dcterms:description "This pathway depicts the epileptogenic mechanisms involving GABA and glutamate signaling. It focuses on transporters and channel proteins that modulate action potential dynamics and their interacting partners, highlighting functional alterations that contribute to epilepsy pathogenesis." ;
